274	    /**
275	     * A claim as shown: the amount with two decimals, the date as yyyy-mm-dd, and the due fixed when it was
276	     * settled (null when it has none, so its due is worked out from the current rate), and who opened it;
277	     * whether the person's last statement bound it, and the due it bound it to (null: none, so n/a); and the number of
278	     * the claim it corrects (null unless it is a correction); and the date that decides how its live figures round (its
279	     * own, or a correction's corrected claim's); and its place in its person's list (a later place listed first); and
280	     * its status log, oldest first; and the date it is deferred until (null when never deferred); and how many proofs
281	     * it has; and the number of the claim it was split off (null unless it was); and the user whose open editor locks
282	     * it (null when not locked); and the last day it was reminded (null when never); and its external reference (null
283	     * when it has none); and its tags, sorted and comma separated (null when it has none); and the reason it was voided
284	     * with (null when none); and its comments, oldest first; and the bulk settle batch that settled it (null when none).
285	     */
